{
  "_about": "HP-Ready end-to-end test houses. All houses are fictional (no real address, person or listing); specs are set to realistic German values (Heizspiegel 2025 consumption bands, IWU/BWP heat-load rules of thumb). Photos are real, openly licensed pictures from Wikimedia Commons, listed in photos.json; run fetch_photos.py on your own machine to download them into photos/. expected_reads = what each reader (text parser, radiator photo, exterior photo) should return. expected_house = the merged House if every reader is right; run_cases.py feeds it straight to the engine, so the engine is tested even without an API key. expected = what a heating installer would accept as an honest answer.",
  "cases": [
    {
